    \u2013 MABATING\r\nPARALAN \u2013 PRUBLEMA\r\nPARIS \u2013 GANSAL\r\nPAYANDARAN
    \u2013 TUKNANG\r\nPAYNAWA \u2013 MAGOBRA\r\nPEKAMATAS \u2013 PEKAMABABA\r\nPERMANENTI
